{"date": "2026-11-18", "title": "Snow on the peaks Sunday 22 November, then nothing serious: what to expect in the coming weeks", "lead": ["For the next few days the high-resolution models lead: they see snowfall Sunday 22 November, about 23 cm at Monte Cimone (2165 m). It's a short episode, to be confirmed in the next updates.", "Beyond that episode, the long-range view of the global models sees no other serious snow.", "We combined 297 scenarios from 8 different weather models, up to Thursday 17 December.", "🌡️ Too mild throughout: up high it stays above freezing (lowest +1 °C on Wednesday 25 November)"], "phases": [{"emoji": "🌧️", "label": "Next 5 days", "text": "From Wed 18 to Sun 22: mostly Rain (51 scenarios out of 100). Snow: very unlikely (0 out of 100), seen by 0 models out of 8. Typical temperature up high around +6 °C, reliability medium. The coarse-grid global models miss the snowfall on the peaks on Sunday 22 November that the high-resolution ones see: in these cases trust the local forecast.", "color": "#94a3b8"}, {"emoji": "☀️", "label": "Days 6 to 10", "text": "From Mon 23 to Fri 27: mostly Dry and mild (50 scenarios out of 100). Snow: very unlikely (6 out of 100), seen by 0 models out of 7. Typical temperature up high around +4 °C, reliability medium.", "color": "#fbbf24"}, {"emoji": "☀️", "label": "Days 11 to 15", "text": "From Sat 28 to Wed 2: mostly Dry and mild (55 scenarios out of 100). Snow: very unlikely (3 out of 100), seen by 0 models out of 5. Typical temperature up high around +5 °C, reliability low.", "color": "#fbbf24"}, {"emoji": "☀️", "label": "Days 16 to 30", "text": "From Thu 3 to Thu 17: mostly Dry and mild (49 scenarios out of 100). Snow: very unlikely (7 out of 100), seen by 0 models out of 2. Typical temperature up high around +3 °C, reliability low.", "color": "#fbbf24"}], "models": ["No model sees serious snow: the most optimistic, UK Met Office, gets to 17 snowy scenarios out of 100."], "weekend": ["Saturday: Good weather pre